[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9840.469, "timestamp": "02:44:00", "text": "我在看视频、直播之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9842.87, "timestamp": "02:44:02", "text": "是啊，那肯定很有趣。但是但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9844.55, "timestamp": "02:44:04", "text": "问题是，然后你就会遇到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9846.309, "timestamp": "02:44:06", "text": "另一个问题是，谁来……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9848.91, "timestamp": "02:44:08", "text": "谁来继承这栋房子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9852.55, "timestamp": "02:44:12", "text": "啊，你说得对。是的，因为因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9854.55, "timestamp": "02:44:14", "text": "那么，因为如果你们两个都是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9857.75, "timestamp": "02:44:17", "text": "如果这房子疯到这种程度，那它就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9860.55, "timestamp": "02:44:20", "text": "可能会有点混乱。是的，我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9863.59, "timestamp": "02:44:23", "text": "我不想要那种像阿斯彭女孩一样的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9866.23, "timestamp": "02:44:26", "text": "是的。不，不，我不想那样。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9868.07, "timestamp": "02:44:28", "text": "我在想什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9870.389, "timestamp": "02:44:30", "text": "你得到一个女孩，一个专门的女孩。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9872.95, "timestamp": "02:44:32", "text": "就喜欢看主播，谁不喜欢呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9874.2, "timestamp": "02:44:34", "text": "流媒体。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9880.71, "timestamp": "02:44:40", "text": "你看，我是在给你一些建议，告诉你该怎么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9884.389, "timestamp": "02:44:44", "text": "你想住在日本。是的，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9886.429, "timestamp": "02:44:46", "text": "其实我根本没想过这个问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9890.07, "timestamp": "02:44:50", "text": "不过，谢谢你。他呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9892.55, "timestamp": "02:44:52", "text": "女朋友？是啊，我当时就想，我要集中精力。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9895.11, "timestamp": "02:44:55", "text": "关于学习、生活以及所有的一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9897.51, "timestamp": "02:44:57", "text": "到那时，如果我能更好地应对，我就会……"}]